{"RukuNumber":456,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":51,"SurahIndex":"051","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ضَيۡفِ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ ٱلۡمُكۡرَمِينَ","TajweedText":"هَلْ أَتَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ حَدِيثُ ضَيْفِ إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>هِيمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُكْرَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":521,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":456,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":51,"SurahIndex":"051","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِذۡ دَخَلُواْ عَلَيۡهِ فَقَالُواْ سَلَٰمٗاۖ قَالَ سَلَٰمٞ قَوۡمٞ مُّنكَرُونَ","TajweedText":"إِذْ دَخَلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَيْهِ فَقَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> سَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>مًا‌ۖ ق</tajweed>َالَ سَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>مٌ ق</tajweed>َوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ م</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":521,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":456,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":51,"SurahIndex":"051","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَرَاغَ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِۦ فَجَآءَ بِعِجۡلٖ سَمِينٖ","TajweedText":"فَرَاغَ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أَهْلِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> فَج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ بِعِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>لٍ س</tajweed>َم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":521,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":456,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecim